# Web agents

Next.js 16 App Router, React 19, Chakra UI 3. Before a Next or Chakra API, read the installed docs (`node_modules/next/dist/docs/` or the Chakra MCP).

Always delegate project work to `orchestrator` in `.cursor/agents/`. Do not call the other subagents yourself. Orchestrator delegates further and skips stages that do not apply.

Checks: `npm run type-check`, `npm run lint`, `npm test`. camelCase. No commits, pushes, or branch switches unless asked. Do not edit translation JSON. Leave the Next.js block in `AGENTS.md` unchanged.
